1155.2,Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Ali ibn Abi Talib used to say that if a man said to his wife
1156.1,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said that statements like \\""I cut myself off from you"""
1156.2,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said that statements like \\""I cut myself off from you"""
1157.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad that a certain man had taken a slave-girl belonging to somebody else as a wife. He said to her people
1157.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad that a certain man had taken a slave-girl belonging to somebody else as a wife. He said to her people
