1164.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim from his father that A'isha
1165.1,Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Umar and Abu Hurayra were asked about a man who gave his wife power over herself
1165.2,Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Umar and Abu Hurayra were asked about a man who gave his wife power over herself
