1178.2,ahya related to me from Malik that he asked Ibn Shihab about the dhihar of a slave. He said
1179.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad that A'isha umm al-muminin
1179.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad that A'isha umm al-muminin
