1197.1,"And from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Umm Hakim bint al-Harith ibn Hisham, who was married to Ikrimah ibn Abi Jahl, accepted Islam on the day of the Conquest, and her husband Ikrimah ibn Abi Jahl fled from Islam until he arrived in Yemen. Umm Hakim then traveled until she came to him in Yemen and called him to"
